Note: E21 ownership. A variable stored into itself, through a rule that returns its own text, shrunk and grown.
§1 Let t be "abc".
§2 Set t to t.
§3 Set t to t followed by t.
§4 Define r as t.
§5 Set t to r.
§6 Let u be r followed by "!".
§7 Set t to "x".
§8 Set t to u.
§9 Say t followed by "|" followed by u.
